Features For home garden, up to four water stations up to 10m away, expandable up to 12, two 2W/hour control modes, wireless programming capability, outdoor temperature sensor, up to 21d interval watering mode, up to 22 stations, up to 2 water sources, and up to 22 times automatically watering.Watering: One of the most important aspect. The irrigation of your plants is the first step. Watering should be done twice a week. If possible, watering should be done in the afternoon but not in the afternoon. The water should be allowed to soak the soil. The temperature of the water should be about 15 degrees Celsius.Do not mix the fertilizer and the herbicide. In most cases, herbicide will not do any harm if they are mixed, but you should check the label on the herbicide before actually mixing it.There is also a fertilizer that can be used in combination with herbicide.The most important thing when planting flowers is to water them every day. Plants need water but not too much. You should water plants at least twice a day. Watering plants too often can cause roots to rot.
